<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $64 (FIM 318.60).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $64 (FIM 318.60).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed $3-1/8 lower at $64 in New York on Thursday after it had published its 1996 earnings report in Helsinki on Thursday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 318.60 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia A closed down four markka at 319.00 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up at $36-3/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 91.50 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 2.20 markka at 92.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR ended $0-3/8 higher at $23-1/8 in New York on Thursday. The price equals about 115.11 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Thursday, Rauma closed up 4.50 markka at 117.50.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
